<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady to firm, steers in short supply. Trade fairly active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1350 lbs 63.00-65.00.  Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 62.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 61.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 62.50-64.25, few head 64.50.  Select and Choice 2-3 950-1100 lbs 61.50-62.50. Select 1-2 60.50-61.50.</p>
</text>
